x + (neg y) => x - y and x - (neg y) => x + y for floats, both
directions, plus the commuted Add spelling. Exact for every numeric
input and both zeros (IEEE 754 defines sub as the addition of the
negation, and the zero-sign table is symmetric); the qNaN sign of the
result may differ when y's NaN is the propagated one — the C11 6.5p8
latitude.

ADJUDICATION (why unconditional): the first cut carried a single-use
guard (the house 'latitude only when the materialisation dies' rule),
but the oracle survey showed every compiler in the competition set
folds with NO use analysis — gcc 14.2/16.2, clang 23.1 and ICX all
emit the mirrored op for the MULTI-USE shapes too (gcc: (x + t) +
(x * t) with t = -y compiles to vsubsd + vfnmadd132sd — the add
folds, the product's negation rides the family, t never
materialises). With every oracle taking the latitude, NOT folding is
what diverges from the competition on NaN-sign rows; the guard
inverted its own purpose (it also blocked the motivating cascade).
The house rule stands for the FMA peel, where lccc remains the more
conservative compiler; here bit-parity REQUIRES the fold.

The composition closes two targets to GCC parity:
- chain_pin (t = -x; r = fma(-t, b, c); return r + t): the neg-of-neg
  fold makes the fma read x through the PLAIN family, this fold makes
  the add r - x, and the pinned inner's last reader dies — ZERO sign
  masks, vfmadd + vsub, gcc's exact instruction pair.
- map_extneg (t = -x[i]; r[i] = fma(t, b[i], c) + t): the same
  cascade inside the loop — the add folds to a subtraction, the
  negation becomes absorbable, the map parse vectorizes: 4-wide
  vfnmadd231pd reading x positive + vsubpd, no negation
  materialisation (gcc: same composition at 2-wide).

Value matrix: 14-row battery (all four ±0 combinations, subnormal
pairs, mixed infinities, NaN in both operand positions) bit-exact vs
gcc. The audit's residual #2 (map-side multi-use peel) is thereby
STALE — empirically verified: the all-fma-readers shapes already
vectorized with family absorption via the loop-body mini-peel; the
real map-side gaps are the two-store loop limitation and the
double-load CSE, both documented for the follow-up list.

Tests: 8 new units (both directions, commuted spelling, f32, the
multi-use adjudication pin, the historical integer pin, non-neg and
const negative controls) + the historical test_sub_neg_float_not_
simplified REWRITTEN in place as the record of the flip. Gate:
chain_pin pins advanced to the zero-mask truth (0 xorpd, 1 vfmadd, 1
vsubsd). Skip family: CCC_SIMPLIFY_SKIP=addneg. Validation: cargo
3114/0; corpus 728/0/20 AB-diff 0 CCC_VERIFY_IR=abort armed;
correctness oracle 57/57; ISA gate + cross-PR battery PASS; 53
contract gates PASS; fmt + clippy clean.
